<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ to hold pensions postal ballot in Sept - Graham.</title>
<headline>NZ to hold pensions postal ballot in Sept - Graham.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>New Zealand Justice Minister Doug Graham said on Tuesday a postal ballot on compulsory superannuation would be held over a three week period in September.</p>
<p>&quot;On the curent timetable, the most likely dates will be the three weeks beginning September 5 and ending at 7 p.m. on September 26,&quot; Graham said in a statement.</p>
</text>
